I’m considering whether a full clamp is really necessary here. The text surface only needs the inner part, not the entire quote. If I tap near the left padding or border area, the positionFromGlobalOffset might miss the surface, especially if global.x is less than the surface left. I need to look closely at how this interacts with padding and the rect boundaries. I'll focus on line 390 and how padding impacts the clickable area.
